      "not_checked": "Line 58's claim that the chloridazon animal-product exception is 'the one case so far' with parts_from legal_guidance concerns all 684 rd-bridge records; the excerpt holds only 4, so only those 4 could be checked, and within them it holds. Line 89 says the wiki cites model readings only where it flags them. Whether that holds for the context page pesticide-residue-definition-by-matrix.md could not be settled. That page cites rd-bridge component splits for acetamiprid (residue_id 10) without stating their parts_from status, and that record is not in the excerpt. Line 65's statement that the guided_model split 'has not been checked against the legal act' is the wiki's inference from the parts_from value; the dataset does not state it explicitly."
    },
